    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d561">

                <pb facs="0502" n="386" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg386"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 738.3915/183.]</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Dominican Minister to the
                            Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dominican Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-11-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 22, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Secretary</hi>: I have the honor to send to you
                    herewith in Spanish, marked No. 1, the minutes of the six conferences that we
                    have had <pb facs="0503" n="387" xml:id="pg387"/> at the Department of State
                    relating to the settlement of the boundary dispute pending between the Dominican
                    Republic and the Republic of Haiti, signed by the Haitian Plenipotentiary and by
                        me.<anchor n="1" xml:id="d561-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Since the 13th of last July there has been no exchange of views between the two
                    plenipotentiaries other than those of August 8 last; copies<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d561-f2"/> of these are enclosed, marked Nos. 2 and 3.</p>
                <p>I avail [etc.],</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Fran’co J. Peynado.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d561-f1" n="1" xml:id="d561-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed. The minutes are not dated; those of the sixth meeting show a formal
                    exchange of the views expressed informally at the fifth meeting, as summarized
                    in the memorandum of July 10.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d561-f2" n="2" xml:id="d561-f2-content">
                <p>Not printed; they continue the same matters discussed at the fifth and sixth
                    meetings.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
